 "▼ Dive in: <0>Decide</0>": "",
 "A plain <0/> loop around the chat API is a complete agent. Frameworks add structure, not magic.": "",
 "Reach for <0>LangGraph</0> when you need durable state, human-in-the-loop pauses, branching/parallelism or resumable long runs.": "",
 "<0>LangChain</0> components (models, tools, retrievers, LCEL) are building blocks usable with either.": "",
 "Costs of frameworks: another abstraction to debug, API churn, and hidden prompts. Costs of plain code: you build persistence and approval flows yourself.": "",
 "See <0>LangChain agents</0> and <1>the raw agent loop</1>.": "",
